        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/craig/{size}/2150_2.png",
        "created_at": "2018-01-23T19:56:24.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Hey, everyone!</p><p>Look at how early I'm starting this year! I need people for Gen Con, and I want them to be you!</p><p>Here's the short version. We need Citizens to help us out with our presence at Gen Con this year. It's a heck of a lot of fun. You'll get to hang out with us, meet new people, play lots of games, and even have plenty of time to enjoy the show! We'll get you a badge in exchange for a few hours each day, and we'll even take you out for a big dinner the Wednesday night before it all begins!</p><p>If this sounds like a thing you'd be interested in doing, let me know! If we've never spoken before, my email address is craig@greaterthangames.com. I can't wait to hear from you!</p>",
        "post_number": 1,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:50:51.781Z",
        "reply_count": 0,
        "reply_to_post_number": null,
