        "created_at": "2018-01-23T23:05:32.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Maybe.</p><p>Moving parts that need to get worked out include whether I get to keep my current job after May (which seems likely), lodging (a non-trivial endeavour that weekend), and that my son would like to be able to be there for part of it, but that if I'm sharing a hotel room giving him a space in it for a night might get tricky.</p><p>I'd <em>like</em> to. I just don't know if I <em>can</em> yet.</p>",
